<title>JAPAN: Kagoshima Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kagoshima Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    45.08		vs	   50.78</p>
<p> Operating	    8.70		vs	    9.63</p>
<p> Current		6.52		vs	    7.27</p>
<p> Net		    4.93		vs	    3.42</p>
<p> EPS		   23.56 yen	  vs	   16.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    209 million	  vs	 209 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kagoshima Bank Ltd is a Kyushu-based regional bank.</p>
